acceptance_criteria: Adapt pm-jev tooling; no scheduled release; full authored source coverage; documentation and duplication clean; npm and Bun release gates; npm/npx and native Bun/bunx packed installs; real public read-only acceptance.
parent: pm-review-epic
release: 2026.10.12
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-12T10:55:51.852Z",pi-glm-quality,"Plan: implement scripts/main-invocation.ts, scripts/docstring-gate.ts and a compact c8-based scripts/coverage-gate.ts (package.json coverageGate config; c8 --all include src+scripts+root entry, exclude tests/dist/node_modules; json-summary/json/lcov; report invalidation on start and failure; disk-inventory reconciliation against the summary). Cover scripts via test/tooling.test.ts (real child executions plus importable functions; c8 aggregates child coverage) and add test/install.acceptance.ts (pack allowlist, isolated npm+Bun consumers, real SDK temp trackers, npx/bunx registration). Review .github workflows against the scaffolded package; expected no-op since guards already reference PM_REVIEW_RELEASE_ENABLED and workflow_dispatch only."
  "2026-10-12T11:16:46.204Z",codex-sol,"Orchestrator adopted and verified the CLI worker drafts after the GLM quota check showed only four percent remaining. Further worker calls were stopped. Packed npm/npx and native Bun/bunx consumers both passed: allowlisted tarball, four command help surfaces, typed schema registration, offline precedent query and search in independent real trackers. Coverage and full release gates are still being completed."
  "2026-10-12T11:37:35.004Z",codex-sol,"Final quality receipts: fresh npm ci passed; both full npm and Bun gates and the isolated Git-identity full npm gate passed. Packed artifacts passed in independent npm/npx and native Bun/bunx workspaces. The fixture-backed transport and real tracker tests pass at unchanged 100/100/100/100 thresholds. Four development audit entries from one braces advisory remain tracked by pm-review-dev-audit; production audit is clean."
